OL,3,GNEWSA15 vehicles towed in first weekend
OL,4,Aof Goose Fair
OL,5,
OL,6,FFifteen drivers have had their vehicles
OL,7,Ftowed away for parking near the site of
OL,8,Fthe Goose Fair in Nottingham.
OL,10,FNottingham City Council said it had
OL,11,Fexpanded the parking restrictions on
OL,12,Froads around the Forest Recreation
OL,13,FGround site this year.
OL,15,FA spokesperson added an estimated
OL,16,F172,962 people attended the first three
OL,17,Fdays of the fair, during which 530
OL,18,FPenalty Charge Notices were handed out
OL,19,Fand the 15 vehicles were removed.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
